    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "header",
            "block_content": "Section 52A ",
            "block_bbox": [
                900,
                90,
                1046,
                116
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "other Acts.Obligations to beneficiaries override obligations under certain ",
            "block_bbox": [
                327,
                140,
                1000,
                190
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) The obligations of the director under paragraph (2)(d) override any conflicting obligations the director has under:",
            "block_bbox": [
                280,
                215,
                1043,
                274
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) Part 2D.1 of the Corporations Act 2001; or ",
            "block_bbox": [
                339,
                280,
                857,
                307
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) Subdivision A of Division 3 of Part 2-2 of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013(which deals with general duties of officials) or any rules made for the purposes of that Subdivision.",
            "block_bbox": [
                337,
                313,
                1007,
                425
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Director not prevented from engaging or authorising persons to act on behalf of the trustee \n",
            "block_bbox": [
                310,
                456,
                1020,
                507
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(4) A covenant referred to in paragraph (2)(e) does not prevent the director from engaging or authorising persons to do acts or things on behalf of the trustee.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                265,
                535,
                1033,
                615
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Using reasonable care and diligence to ensure compliance by corporate trustee \n",
            "block_bbox": [
                304,
                650,
                997,
                703
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(5) The reference in paragraph (2)(f) to a reasonable degree of care and diligence is a reference to the degree of care and diligence that a superannuation entity director would exercise in the circumstances of the corporate trustee.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                259,
                729,
                1048,
                841
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Covenants operate as if director party to the governing rules ",
            "block_bbox": [
                303,
                874,
                986,
                898
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(6) A covenant referred to in subsection (2) operates as if the director were a party to the governing rules.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                257,
                924,
                1038,
                977
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Superannuation entity director ",
            "block_bbox": [
                303,
                1009,
                655,
                1033
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(7) A superannuation entity director is a person whose profession,business or employment is or includes acting as director of a corporate trustee of a superannuation entity and investing money on behalf of beneficiaries of the superannuation entity.",
            "block_bbox": [
                258,
                1057,
                1025,
                1167
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 12
        },
        {
            "block_label": "footer",
            "block_content": "Superannuation Industry (Supervision) Act 1993",
